sequenceDiagram
    participant Application
    participant SpringFramework as SpringFramework
    participant TenantRoutingDataSource
    participant determineCurrentLookupKey
    participant ThreadTenantStorage
    participant AbstractRoutingDataSource
    participant DataSourcePool as DataSourcePool
    participant System.out

    Application->>SpringFramework: request database connection
    activate SpringFramework
    SpringFramework->>TenantRoutingDataSource: getConnection
    activate TenantRoutingDataSource
    TenantRoutingDataSource->>determineCurrentLookupKey: call determineCurrentLookupKey method
    activate determineCurrentLookupKey
    par
        determineCurrentLookupKey->>System.out: log tenant lookup operation
        Note right of System.out: Logging operation
    and
        determineCurrentLookupKey->>ThreadTenantStorage: retrieve tenant identifier
        activate ThreadTenantStorage
        ThreadTenantStorage-->>determineCurrentLookupKey: Tenant identifier from thread local storage
        deactivate ThreadTenantStorage
    end
    determineCurrentLookupKey->>AbstractRoutingDataSource: return tenant identifier as lookup key
    activate AbstractRoutingDataSource
    deactivate determineCurrentLookupKey
    AbstractRoutingDataSource->>DataSourcePool: route to tenant-specific data source
    activate DataSourcePool
    DataSourcePool-->>TenantRoutingDataSource: connection obtained
    deactivate DataSourcePool
    deactivate AbstractRoutingDataSource
    TenantRoutingDataSource-->>SpringFramework: return connection
    deactivate TenantRoutingDataSource
    SpringFramework-->>Application: Tenant-specific database connection
    deactivate SpringFramework